Use the preallocated Solaris gdm account for greeter and XDMCP chooser
sessions, including simultaneous displays. Never treat its persistent home
as a disposable dynamic-user home. Restore the RequiredComponents list
needed by Solaris gnome-session 45, which has no systemd service manager.

